{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o003b","title":"以司马懿为太傅持节统兵如故","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o003b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"以司马懿为太傅持节统兵如故","evidence":["shaodi-e-o003b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o003b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":239,"label":"二月丁丑","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y239","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o002","basis":"二月丁丑"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o003b-q","shaodi-q-o002","mingdi-q-o068","mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o003b-q","source_order":[4,4,"O003b"],"order":982}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e59395a0e3cfa7e31144","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗三年：景初三年（公元 239）。丁亥：旧历初一日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":496,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-271e1436daf6e49feb83","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o068","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-15faf626ce48eb2f68b4","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，丁亥〖4〗，太尉宣王还至河内；帝驿马召到〖5〗，引入卧内，执其手谓曰：“吾疾甚！以后事属君。君其与爽辅少子〖6〗。吾得见君，无所恨！”宣王顿首流涕〖7〗。﹝一﹞即日，帝崩于嘉福殿。﹝二﹞时年三十六〖8〗。﹝三﹞癸丑〖9〗，葬高平陵〖10〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o003b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-12dc688f5cbb820f9817","layer":"original","quote":"二月，西域重译献火浣布〖10〗，诏大将军、太尉临试以示百僚。﹝二﹞丁丑诏曰〖11〗：“太尉体道正直〖12〗，尽忠三世〖13〗；南擒孟达，西破蜀虏，东灭公孙渊：功盖海内。昔周成建保傅之官〖14〗，近汉显宗崇宠邓禹〖15〗；所以优隆俊乂〖16〗，必有尊也〖17〗。其以太尉为太傅，持节统兵、都督诸军事如故。”三月，以征东将军满宠为太尉。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o002","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-69d95c2d10b2c4a40b0c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年，立为齐王。景初三年正月，丁亥朔，帝病甚，乃立为皇太子。是日，即皇帝位。大赦。尊皇后曰皇太后〖2〗。大将军曹爽、太尉司马宣王辅政。诏曰：“朕以眇身〖3〗，继承鸿业。茕茕在疚〖4〗，靡所控告〖5〗。大将军、太尉奉受末命〖6〗，夹辅朕躬；司徒、司空，冢宰元辅总率百僚〖7〗，以宁社稷；其与群卿大夫勉勖乃心〖8〗，称朕意焉。”诸所兴作宫室之役，皆以遗诏罢之；官奴婢六十以上，免为良人〖9〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
